Dialogue: 4,0:47:51.13,0:47:53.27,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}う～ん 当たるかな～？
Dialogue: 5,0:47:53.27,0:47:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}估计中个屁吧
Dialogue: 4,0:47:53.27,0:47:55.60,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当ったらねえだろうな～
Dialogue: 5,0:47:55.60,0:47:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}能懂吗
Dialogue: 4,0:47:55.60,0:47:58.27,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}分かるかなあ
Dialogue: 5,0:47:58.27,0:48:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}估计懂个屁吧
